# Engine GLSL snippets are baked byte-for-byte into the executable by CMake
# (generated/EmbeddedGlslSnippets.cpp) and asserted byte-exact by
# tests/glsl_snippets_test.cpp. With core.autocrlf=true and no attribute here, a
# Windows checkout rewrote all 28 of them to CRLF, which:
#   - put a stray CR after every injected `#define` in the shader preamble handed
#     to the GLSL compiler (e.g. "#define MC_TEXTURE_FORMAT_LAB_PBR\r"),
#   - made the embedded table disagree with the source files, and
#   - failed GlslSnippetsTest.EmbeddedMapMatchesSourceFiles,
#     GlslSnippetsTest.EngineSnippetsPreserveOriginalText and
#     ShaderGlIntegrationTest.PreambleMatchesRenderStageAndLabPbrMacros on every
#     Windows working tree while passing on LF checkouts.
# Pin them to LF so the shipped shader text is checkout-independent.
src/net/minecraft/client/render/shaders/glsl/*.glsl text eol=lf
